,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ラーメンとかも食べるの遅いんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めん類はとくに遅いんですヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、具を全部食べ切ってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メインの めんを 食べはじめるという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜにブリリアントな癖があります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっちを食べてこっちを食べてっていうのが出来ないんです(￣◇￣;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○髪切る予定ゎある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切るんだったらどんな髪型にする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか ばっさりショートにする！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんは一人で外食したり、映画見たり、みたいなことはできるのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ、一人が好きなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも一人でふらっと何処へでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってしまいます( ´▽｀)ふひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんは数学は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意ではなかったかもだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生も授業も大好きでした( *^_^* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/8361214/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんはウインク出来ますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近できるようになったんです(*^^*)えっへん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超スロー だけどｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんのはじめてのおつかいは何だったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーんと、私のはじめてのおつかいは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2 • 3歳の時に、一つ上のお兄ちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「妹のために、俺が買ってきてやる！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、おばあちゃんから貰った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"500円玉を握りしめて、お菓子を買いに行ってくれたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、家の前の広場でブランコに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗りながら待ってたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何分もしないうちにお兄ちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きながら帰ってきて、、(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、2人で買いに行ったんです。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが、私のはじめてのおつかいでした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて自分たちで買ったお菓子は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜかいつもの何倍よりも美味しかったです ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○もしかしてさゆにゃんは、物を無くし易いタイプですか？？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかそれ以前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボケているらしいです＾＾  ;（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に、友達と携帯電話で話しながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯無くしちゃった～ (´･_･`)って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ったことがあります、  笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんはお祭り行かないのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人ごみ苦手なの です（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんは海の家に行ったら、何食べますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、今まで海に遊びに行ったことがなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水着も持ってなくて、去年初めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海水浴に行ったんです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで食べたアイスクリームが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったから、また食べたいなぁ～＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/8361214/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○アニメで一番好きなシーンとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの花の最終回、ラストのシーンで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンマちゃんが「見つかっちゃった＾＾ニコッ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、消えちゃうところヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんまぁぁああぅおゔえお！！！号泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○夏の匂いってどんなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅんわふわふくしゅぶぉわぁくゅりっす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じですヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ こたえられてないのも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山あってごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徐々にこたえてくからね～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/8361214/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"parag